{"text":"kuruntokai","n":47,"lines":["கருங்கால் வேங்கை வீயுகு துறுகல்","இரும்புலிக் குருளையின் தோன்றுங் காட்டிடை","எல்லி வருநர் களவிற்கு","நல்லை யல்லை நெடுவெண் ணிலவே"],"tr":["karuṅkāl vēṅkai vīyuku tuṟukal","irumpulik kuruḷaiyiṉ tōṉṟuṅ kāṭṭiṭai","elli varunar kaḷaviṟku","nallai yallai neṭuveṇ ṇilavē"],"colophon":{"tinai":"kuṟiñci","tinai_ta":"குறிஞ்சி","speaker_ta":"தோழி கூற்று","poet_ta":"நெடுவெண்ணிலவினார்","speaker_en":"her friend (tōḻi)","poet_tr":"Neṭuveṇṇilaviṉār"},"scan":{"meter":"nēricai āciriyappā","ok":true,"checks":[{"name":"lines","ok":true,"detail":"4 lines"},{"name":"feet per line","ok":true,"detail":"3×4, 1×3 feet"},{"name":"foot types","ok":true,"detail":"iyaṟcīr 13, veṇcīr 2"},{"name":"linkage","ok":true,"detail":"veṇṭaḷai 8, āciriyattaḷai 6"},{"name":"ending","ok":true,"detail":"ends on ஏ"}],"ending":"ஏ","lines":[[{"text":"கருங்கால்","tr":"karuṅkāl","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"கருங்","tr":"karuṅ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"கால்","tr":"kāl"}]},{"text":"வேங்கை","tr":"vēṅkai","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"வேங்","tr":"vēṅ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"கை","tr":"kai"}]},{"text":"வீயுகு","tr":"vīyuku","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"வீ","tr":"vī"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"யுகு","tr":"yuku"}]},{"text":"துறுகல்","tr":"tuṟukal","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"துறு","tr":"tuṟu"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"கல்","tr":"kal"}]}],[{"text":"இரும்புலிக்","tr":"irumpulik","foot":"karuviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"இரும்","tr":"irum"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"புலிக்","tr":"pulik"}]},{"text":"குருளையின்","tr":"kuruḷaiyiṉ","foot":"puḷimāṅkāy","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"குரு","tr":"kuru"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ளை","tr":"ḷai"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"யின்","tr":"yiṉ"}]},{"text":"தோன்றுங்","tr":"tōṉṟuṅ","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"தோன்","tr":"tōṉ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"றுங்","tr":"ṟuṅ"}]},{"text":"காட்டிடை","tr":"kāṭṭiṭai","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"காட்","tr":"kāṭ"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"டிடை","tr":"ṭiṭai"}]}],[{"text":"எல்லி","tr":"elli","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"எல்","tr":"el"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"லி","tr":"li"}]},{"text":"வருநர்","tr":"varunar","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"வரு","tr":"varu"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"நர்","tr":"nar"}]},{"text":"களவிற்கு","tr":"kaḷaviṟku","foot":"puḷimāṅkāy","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"கள","tr":"kaḷa"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"விற்","tr":"viṟ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"கு","tr":"ku"}]}],[{"text":"நல்லை","tr":"nallai","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"நல்","tr":"nal"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"லை","tr":"lai"}]},{"text":"யல்லை","tr":"yallai","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"யல்","tr":"yal"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"லை","tr":"lai"}]},{"text":"நெடுவெண்","tr":"neṭuveṇ","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"நெடு","tr":"neṭu"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"வெண்","tr":"veṇ"}]},{"text":"ணிலவே","tr":"ṇilavē","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"ணில","tr":"ṇila"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"வே","tr":"vē"}]}]]},"ai":{"lines":[{"words":[{"surface":"கருங்கால்","parts":[{"text":"கரும்","lemma":"கருமை","gloss":"black"},{"text":"கால்","lemma":"கால்","gloss":"trunk"}],"gloss":"black-trunked"},{"surface":"வேங்கை","parts":[{"text":"வேங்கை","lemma":"வேங்கை","gloss":"kino tree"}],"gloss":"kino tree"},{"surface":"வீயுகு","parts":[{"text":"வீ","lemma":"வீ","gloss":"blossom"},{"text":"உகு","lemma":"உகு","gloss":"shedding"}],"gloss":"shedding blossoms"},{"surface":"துறுகல்","parts":[{"text":"துறு","lemma":"துறு","gloss":"rounded"},{"text":"கல்","lemma":"கல்","gloss":"boulder"}],"gloss":"rounded boulder"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"இரும்புலி","parts":[{"text":"இரும்","lemma":"இரும்பு","gloss":"big"},{"text":"புலி","lemma":"புலி","gloss":"tiger"}],"gloss":"big tiger"},{"surface":"குருளையின்","parts":[{"text":"குருளை","lemma":"குருளை","gloss":"cub"},{"text":"இன்","lemma":"இன்","gloss":"like"}],"gloss":"like a cub"},{"surface":"தோன்றும்","parts":[{"text":"தோன்றும்","lemma":"தோன்று","gloss":"appearing"}],"gloss":"appearing"},{"surface":"காட்டிடை","parts":[{"text":"காட்டிடை","lemma":"காட்டிடை","gloss":"in the forest"}],"gloss":"in the forest","split_unverified":true}]},{"words":[{"surface":"எல்லி","parts":[{"text":"எல்லி","lemma":"எல்லி","gloss":"night"}],"gloss":"night"},{"surface":"வருநர்","parts":[{"text":"வரு","lemma":"வா","gloss":"come"},{"text":"நர்","lemma":"நர்","gloss":"he who"}],"gloss":"he who comes"},{"surface":"களவிற்கு","parts":[{"text":"களவு","lemma":"களவு","gloss":"secret tryst"},{"text":"இற்கு","lemma":"இக்கு","gloss":"for"}],"gloss":"for the secret tryst"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"நல்லை","parts":[{"text":"நல்","lemma":"நன்மை","gloss":"good"},{"text":"ஐ","lemma":"ஐ","gloss":"you"}],"gloss":"you are good"},{"surface":"அல்லை","parts":[{"text":"அல்","lemma":"அல்","gloss":"not"},{"text":"ஐ","lemma":"ஐ","gloss":"you"}],"gloss":"you are not"},{"surface":"நெடுவெண்ணிலவே","parts":[{"text":"நெடு","lemma":"நெடுமை","gloss":"long"},{"text":"வெள்","lemma":"வெண்மை","gloss":"white"},{"text":"நிலவு","lemma":"நிலவு","gloss":"moonlight"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"O"}],"gloss":"O long white moonlight!"}]}],"literal":"Black-trunked kino tree's shedding-blossom rounded boulder / like a big tiger's cub appearing in the forest / for the secret tryst of him who comes at night / you are good, you are not, O long white moonlight!","translation":"O long, white moonlight! You are not kind to the secret tryst of our lover who comes through the night forest, where boulders covered in fallen blossoms of the black-trunked kino tree look like the cubs of great tigers.","modern":"கரிய அடிமரத்தைக் கொண்ட வேங்கை மரத்தின் உதிர்ந்த மலர்கள் பரவிக் கிடக்கும் பாறையானது, பெரிய புலியின் குட்டியைப் போலத் தோன்றும் காட்டின் வழியே, இரவில் இரகசியமாக நம்மைச் சந்திக்க வரும் தலைவனுடைய களவு ஒழுக்கத்திற்கு, நீண்ட வெண்மையான நிலவே! நீ நல்லவளாக இல்லை.","explanation":"The speaker is the heroine's friend, addressing the bright moonlight. The situation is a night tryst where the hero travels through a dangerous forest path to meet the heroine in secret. The friend addresses the bright, long-lasting white moonlight, saying it is not doing any good to the hero who comes in secret at night. The bright moonlight exposes his path, making his secret visits visible to others, and also reveals the dangers of the forest, such as the boulders covered in yellow Vēṅkai flowers that look like tiger cubs. This belongs to the Kuṟiñci tiṇai (mountainous landscape), characterized by secret night meetings, dangerous paths, and the imagery of tigers and Vēṅkai trees. The key words are 'நெடுவெண்ணிலவே' (O long white moonlight) and 'களவிற்கு நல்லை அல்லை' (you are not good for the secret tryst).","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"},"timing":{"male":[[0.0,0.6],[0.6,1.0],[1.0,2.45],[2.45,2.45],[2.45,2.45],[2.45,3.8],[3.8,4.3],[4.3,4.3],[4.3,6.0],[6.0,6.2],[6.2,6.6],[6.6,7.55],[7.55,8.5],[8.5,8.66],[8.66,9.3]],"female":[[0.0,0.7],[0.7,1.1],[1.1,1.2],[1.2,1.2],[1.2,1.35],[1.35,4.0],[4.0,4.5],[4.5,4.9],[4.9,5.19],[5.19,5.19],[5.19,7.2],[7.2,8.6],[8.6,8.9],[8.9,9.1],[9.24,9.8]]}}